ique of an undirected graph’s simple graph whose size is in a range, once each, lazily,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"each in ","type":"text"},{"code":"vertices","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" order (by vertex index). The order is by the cliques’ first vertex in","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"coreNumbers().degeneracyOrdering","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", then depth first, each clique followed by its extensions by","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"later vertices in ascending index. The sequence holds the graph, so iterating again gives the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"same cliques. O(n + m) before the first clique, O(d) bitset words per clique for degeneracy d.","type":"text"}],"title":"AllCliques","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"AllCliques"}],"type":"topic"},"doc://Cliques/documentation/Cliques/AllCliques/underestimatedCount":{"abstract":[],"role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/cliques\/allcliques\/underestimatedcount","title":"underestimatedCount","type":"topic","fragments":[{"text":"var","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"underestimatedCount","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:Si","text":"Int","kind":"typeIdentifier"}],"kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/Cliques\/documentation\/Cliques\/AllCliques\/underestimatedCount"}}}